hadiths[50]{hadithnumber,text}:
"470","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Zaid bin Rabah aur Ubaidullah bin Abi Abdullah se, unhon ne Abdullah Abu Abdullah Salman Agharr se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke meri is masjid mein Namaz is ke siwa mein hazaar Namaz se behtar hai siwa Masjid-e-Haram ke."
"471","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Sakhtiyani Ayyub bin Abi Tamima se, unhon ne Muhammad bin Sireen se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab aik qoum mein they jab ke wo Quran padh rahe they, phir apni haajat ke liye gae phir laute jab ke wo Quran padh rahe they, to aik shakhs ne un se kaha ke ya Ameerul Momineen kya tum Quran padhte ho jab ke tum wuzu par nahi ho, to Umar ne un se kaha ke tumhein ye kis ne fatwa diya, kya Musailima ne."
"472","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Dawood bin Husain se, unhon ne Aaraj se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman bin Abdul Qari se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab ne kaha ke jis se raat ka apna hissa foot jaye aur use suraj dhalne se Zuhr ki Namaz tak padhe to wo us se foot nahi hua ya goya us ne use pa liya."
"473","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke main aur Muhammad bin Yahya bin Hibban baithe they, phir Muhammad ne aik shakhs ko bulaya aur kaha ke mujhe wo khabar do jo tum ne apne walid se suni. To us shakhs ne kaha ke mere walid ne mujhe khabar di ke wo Zaid bin Sabit ke paas aae aur un se kaha ke saat din mein Quran padhne ke bare mein tum kya dekhte ho, to Zaid ne kaha ke achchha hai, aur agar main use aadhe ya dus mein padhun to mere nazdeek zyada pasand hai, aur mujh se sawal karo ke ye kyun. Unhon ne kaha ke main tum se sawal karta hun. Zaid ne kaha ke taake main is mein ghaur karun aur is par thehrun."
"474","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Urwa bin Zubair se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman bin Abdul Qari se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke maine Umar bin Khattab ko kehte suna ke maine Hisham bin Hakeem bin Hizam ko Surah Furqan padhte suna us se mukhtalif jaisa main padhta tha, jab ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhe padhai thi, to main qareeb tha ke us par jaldi karun phir maine use mohlat di yahan tak ke wo phira, phir maine use us ki chadar se pakda aur use lekar Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha ke ya Rasulullah maine ise Surah Furqan padhte suna us se mukhtalif jaisa Aap ne mujhe padhai thi, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke use chhor do, phir farmaya ke padho aey Hisham. To unhon ne wo qiraat padhi jo maine unhein padhte suna tha, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke isi tarah nazil hui. Phir mujh se farmaya ke padho. To maine padhi to farmaya ke isi tarah nazil hui, ye Quran saat huroof par nazil hua hai to is mein se jo aasan ho padho."
"475","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Quran wale ki misaal bandhi hui oontniyon wale jaisi hai, agar un par laga rahe to unhein roke rakhe aur agar unhein chhor de to chali jain."
"476","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aaisha se riwayat kya ke Haris bin Hisham ne Rasulullah se sawal kya ke Aap ke paas wahi kaisey aati hai, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kabhi mere paas ghanti ki jhankar jaisi aati hai jo mujh par sab se sakht hoti hai, phir mujh se khul jati hai jab ke maine jo kaha yaad kar liya hota hai, aur kabhi farishta mere liye mard ki surat mein aata hai aur mujh se kalam karta hai to main jo kehta hai yaad kar leta hun. Aaisha ne kaha ke maine Aap ko dekha ke Aap par sakht sardi ke din nazil hoti thi aur Aap se khul jati jab ke Aap ki peshani paseene se beh rahi hoti thi."
"477","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Abasa wa Tawalla Abdullah bin Umm Maktoom ke bare mein nazil hui, wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aae aur kehne lage ke aey Muhammad mujhe qareeb karo, jab ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas mushrikon ke badon mein se aik shakhs tha, phir Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) un se munh pherte aur dusre ki taraf mutawajja hote aur kehte ke aey falan ke baap kya tum dekhte ho ke jo main kehta hun us mein harj hai. To wo kehta ke nahi, khoon ki qasam main nahi dekhta ke jo tum kehte ho us mein harj hai. Phir nazil hui ke us ne munh phera aur peeth pheri ke us ke paas andha aaya."
"478","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Zaid bin Aslam se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne baaz safaron mein chal rahe they aur Umar bin Khattab raat mein Aap ke sath chal rahe they, phir Umar ne Aap se kisi cheez ke bare mein sawal kya to Aap ne unhein jawab na diya, phir sawal kya to jawab na diya, phir sawal kya to jawab na diya. To Umar ne kaha ke tumhari maan tumhein gham mein daale aey Umar, tum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko teen martaba kam kya har martaba tumhein jawab na dete. Umar ne kaha ke maine apne oont ko harkat di yahan tak ke jab main logon ke aage tha aur mujhe khauf tha ke mere bare mein Quran nazil ho, phir main na thehra ke maine pukarne wale ko suna jo mujhe pukar raha tha. Unhon ne kaha ke maine kaha ke mujhe khauf tha ke mere bare mein Quran nazil hua hai. Unhon ne kaha ke main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur Aap ko salam kya to Aap ne farmaya ke aaj raat mujh par aik surat nazil hui hai jo mujhe is se zyada pasand hai jis par suraj taloo hua. Phir padha ke hum ne tumhare liye khuli fatah di."
"479","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Taimi Muhammad bin Ibrahim bin Haris se, unhon ne Abu Salma bin Abdur Rahman se, unhon ne Abu Saeed se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmate suna ke tum mein aik qoum nikle gi jin ki Namaz ke sath tum apni Namaz ko aur jin ke rozon ke sath tum apne rozon ko aur jin ke amalon ke sath tum apne amalon ko haqeer samjho ge, wo Quran padhein ge lekin un ke halaq se na guzre ga, wo deen se nikal jain ge jaisa teer shikar se nikal jata hai, tum phal mein dekho ge to koi cheez na dekhoge, aur lakdi mein dekho ge to koi cheez na dekhoge, aur par mein dekho ge to koi cheez na dekhoge, aur nok mein shak karoge."
"480","Mujhe Malik se riwayat pahunchi ke Abdullah bin Umar Surah Baqara par aath saal thehre rahe aur use seekhte rahe."
"481","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Aswad bin Sufyan ke ghulam Abdullah bin Yazeed se, unhon ne Abu Salma bin Abdur Rahman se riwayat kya ke Abu Huraira ne unhein Izas Samaa-un-Shaqqat padhi aur is mein sajda kya, phir jab phire to unhein khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is mein sajda kya tha."
"482","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Umar ke ghulam Nafi se riwayat kya ke Misr walon mein se aik shakhs ne unhein khabar di ke Umar bin Khattab ne Surah Hajj padhi aur is mein do sajde kiye phir kaha ke ye surat do sajdon se fazilat di gai hai."
"483","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Dinar se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke maine Abdullah bin Umar ko dekha ke Surah Hajj mein do sajde karte they."
"484","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Aaraj se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab ne Wan Najmi Iza Hawa padhi aur is mein sajda kya phir khade hue aur dusri surat padhi."
"485","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Abasa wa Tawalla Abdullah bin Umm Maktoom ke bare mein nazil hui, wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aae aur kehne lage ke aey Muhammad mujhe qareeb karo, jab ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas mushrikon ke badon mein se aik shakhs tha, phir Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) un se munh pherte aur dusre ki taraf mutawajja hote aur kehte ke aey falan ke baap kya tum dekhte ho ke jo main kehta hun us mein harj hai. To wo kehta ke nahi, khoon ki qasam main nahi dekhta ke jo tum kehte ho us mein harj hai. Phir nazil hui ke us ne munh phera aur peeth pheri ke us ke paas andha aaya."
"486","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman bin Abdullah bin Abi Sasa se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Khudri Abu Saeed se riwayat kya ke unhon ne aik shakhs ko suna jo Qul Huwallahu Ahad padh raha tha aur use dohra raha tha, phir jab subah hui to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas subah gaya aur Aap ko ye bataya jab ke wo shakhs use kam samajhta tha, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke us zaat ki qasam jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai, ye teesre Quran ke barabar hai."
"487","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ubaidullah bin Abdur Rahman se, unhon ne Zaid bin Khattab ke gharane ke ghulam Ubaid bin Hunain se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke maine Abu Huraira ko kehte suna ke main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath aaya aur Aap ne aik shakhs ko suna jo Qul Huwallahu Ahad padh raha tha to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke wajib ho gai. To maine Aap se sawal kya ke kya ya Rasulullah, to Aap ne farmaya ke Jannat. To Abu Huraira ne kaha ke maine irada kya ke us ki taraf ja kar use khushkhabri dun phir dara ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath subah ka khana mujh se foot jaye, phir maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath subah ke khane ko tarjeeh di phir us shakhs ki taraf gaya to use paya ke wo ja chuka tha."
"488","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman bin Auf ke bete Humaid se riwayat kya ke unhon ne unhein khabar di ke Qul Huwallahu Ahad teesre Quran ke barabar hai aur Tabarak Allazi Biyadihil Mulk apne sathi ki taraf se jhagadti hai."
"489","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Abu Bakr ke ghulam Sumay se, unhon ne Samman Abu Salih se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo din mein sau martaba kahe ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi, wo akela hai, us ka koi shareek nahi, us ke liye badshahat hai aur us ke liye hamd hai aur wo har cheez par qadir hai, to us ke liye dus gardanon ke barabar hai aur us ke liye sau nekiyan likhi jatin hain aur us se sau buraiyan mitai jatin hain aur ye us ke liye us din shaam tak shaitan se hifazat hoti hai, aur koi us se afzal lekar na aaya magar jo is se zyada amal kare."
"490","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abu Bakr ke ghulam Sumay se, unhon ne Samman Abu Salih se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo din mein sau martaba kahe ke Allah apni hamd ke sath paak hai to us se us ki khatayein mitai jatin hain chahe samandar ke jhag jaisi hon."
"491","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Sulaiman bin Abdul Malik ke ghulam Abu Ubaid se, unhon ne Laithi Ata bin Yazeed se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke jo har Namaz ke baad teentees martaba tasbeeh kahe aur teentees martaba takbeer kahe aur teentees martaba hamd kahe aur sau ko La Ilaha Illallah Wahdahu La Shareeka Lah Lahul Mulku wa Lahul Hamdu wa Huwa Ala Kulli Shaiin Qadeer se khatm kare to us ke gunah bakhsh diye jate hain chahe samandar ke jhag jaisey hon."
"492","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Sayyad Ammara bin Sayyad se, unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab se riwayat kya ke unhon ne unhein Baqiyat-us-Salihat ke bare mein kehte suna ke ye bande ka qaul hai ke Allah sab se bada hai aur Allah paak hai aur hamd Allah ke liye hai aur Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi aur gunah se bachna aur taqat sirf Allah se hai."
"493","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ziyad bin Abi Ziyad se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Abu Darda ne kaha ke kya main tumhein tumhare sab se behtareen amalon aur tumhare darjon mein sab se buland aur tumhare malik ke nazdeek sab se paakeeza aur tumhare liye sona chandi dene se behtar aur tumhare liye is se behtar ke tum apne dushman se milo aur un ki gardanein maro aur wo tumhari gardanein marein na bataun. Unhon ne kaha ke kyun nahi. Unhon ne kaha ke Allah Taala ka zikr. Ziyad bin Abi Ziyad ne kaha ke Abu Abdur Rahman Muaz bin Jabal ne kaha ke Ibn Adam ne koi amal nahi kya jo us ke liye Allah ke azaab se zyada nijat dene wala ho Allah ke zikr se."
"494","Mujhe Malik ne Mujmir Nuaim bin Abdullah se, unhon ne Zurqi Ali bin Yahya se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Rafi bin Rafi se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke hum aik din Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke peechhe Namaz padh rahe they, phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne rakat se apna sar uthaya aur kaha ke Allah ne us ki sun li jis ne us ki hamd ki. To Aap ke peechhe aik shakhs ne kaha ke aey hamare Rab aur tere liye hamd hai bahut paakeeza mubarak hamd. Phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) phire to farmaya ke abhi bolne wala kaun hai. To us shakhs ne kaha ke main ya Rasulullah. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke maine tees se zyada farishton ko dekha ke is ki taraf daud rahe hain ke inhein pehle kaun likhe."
"495","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Abul Zinad se, unhon ne Aaraj se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke har nabi ke liye aik dua hai jis se wo dua karta hai, to main chahta hun ke apni dua ko aakhirat mein apni ummat ki shafaat ke liye chhupaun."
"496","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) dua karte kehte ke aey Allah subah ko phadne wale aur raat ko sukoon banane wale aur suraj aur chand ko hisab banane wale, mujh se qarz qaza kar aur mujhe faqr se ghani kar aur mujhe mere kaan aur meri aankh aur meri taqat se teri raah mein faida de."
"497","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abul Zinad se, unhon ne Aaraj se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum mein se koi jab dua kare to na kahe ke aey Allah mujhe bakhsh de agar tu chahe, aey Allah mujh par rehem kar agar tu chahe, use sawal mein pakka hona chahiye kyunke us ke liye koi majboor karne wala nahi."
"498","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Ibn Azhar ke ghulam Abu Ubaid se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum mein se kisi ki dua qubool ki jati hai jab tak jaldi na kare aur kahe ke maine dua ki aur meri dua qubool na hui."
"499","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Agharr Abu Abdullah se aur Abu Salma se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke hamara Rab Tabarak wa Taala har raat duniya ke aasman ki taraf utarta hai jab raat ka aakhri teesra hissa baqi rehta hai aur farmata hai ke kaun mujhe pukarta hai ke main us ki sunun, kaun mujh se mangta hai ke main use dun, kaun mujh se bakhshish mangta hai ke main use bakhsh dun."
"500","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Taimi Muhammad bin Ibrahim bin Haris se riwayat kya ke Ummul Momineen Aaisha ne kaha ke main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke pehlu mein soi hui thi aur raat mein Aap ko na paya to maine apne haath se Aap ko chhuya aur apna haath Aap ke qadmon par rakha jab ke Aap sajde mein keh rahe they ke main teri raza ke zariye tere ghazab se aur teri aafiyat ke zariye teri saza se aur tere zariye tujh se panah mangta hun, main teri tareef ko poora nahi kar sakta, tu waisa hi hai jaisa tune apne aap ki tareef ki."
"501","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ziyad bin Abi Ziyad se, unhon ne Kuraiz ke bete Talha bin Ubaidullah se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke sab se afzal dua Arafa ke din ki dua hai aur sab se afzal jo maine aur mujh se pehle nabiyon ne kaha ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi, wo akela hai, us ka koi shareek nahi."
"502","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Makki Abu Zubair se, unhon ne Yamani Tawoos se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Abbas se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unhein ye dua sikhate they jaisa unhein Quran ki surat sikhate they, kehte ke aey Allah main teri panah mangta hun Jahannam ke azaab se aur teri panah mangta hun qabr ke azaab se aur teri panah mangta hun Maseeh Dajjal ke fitne se aur teri panah mangta hun zindagi aur maut ke fitne se."
"503","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Makki Abu Zubair se, unhon ne Yamani Tawoos se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Abbas se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab raat ke darmiyan se Namaz ke liye khade hote to kehte ke aey Allah tere liye hamd hai, tu aasmanon aur zameen ka noor hai, aur tere liye hamd hai, tu aasmanon aur zameen ko qayam rakhne wala hai, aur tere liye hamd hai, tu aasmanon aur zameen aur jo un mein hain sab ka Rab hai, tu haq hai aur tera qaul haq hai aur tera wada haq hai aur teri mulaqat haq hai aur Jannat haq hai aur aag haq hai aur Qayamat haq hai, aey Allah main tere liye musalman hua aur tujh par iman laya aur tujh par bharosa kya aur teri taraf ruju hua aur tere zariye jhagda aur teri taraf faisla le gaya, to mujhe bakhsh de jo maine aage bheja aur peechhe chhora aur chhupaya aur zaahir kya, tu mera mabood hai, tere siwa koi mabood nahi."
"504","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Abdullah bin Jabir bin Atik se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke hamare paas Abdullah bin Umar Banu Muawiya mein aae jo Ansar ki bastiyon mein se aik basti hai, aur kaha ke kya tum jante ho ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne tumhari is masjid mein se kahan Namaz padhi thi, to maine un se kaha ke haan aur unhein us mein se aik taraf ishara kya, to unhon ne kaha ke kya tum jante ho wo teen jo Aap ne is mein dua ki thin, to maine kaha ke haan. Unhon ne kaha ke mujhe in ki khabar do. To maine kaha ke Aap ne dua ki ke un par un ke siwa koi dushman ghalib na aae aur unhein qahton se halaak na kare to Aap ko dono di gain, aur dua ki ke un ki ladai un ke darmiyan na kare to is se roka gaya. Unhon ne kaha ke tum ne sach kaha. Ibn Umar ne kaha ke Qayamat tak fitna hamesha rahe ga."
"505","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Zaid bin Aslam se riwayat kya ke wo kehte they ke koi pukarne wala dua nahi karta magar teen mein se aik ke darmiyan hota hai, ya to us ki dua qubool ki jati hai ya us ke liye zakheera ki jati hai ya us se us ka kaffara kya jata hai."
"506","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Dinar se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke mujhe Abdullah bin Umar ne dekha jab ke main dua kar raha tha aur do ungliyon se ishara kar raha tha, har haath se aik ungli, to unhon ne mujhe mana kya."
"507","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke Saeed bin Musayyab kehte they ke shakhs apne bete ki us ke baad ki dua se buland kya jata hai, aur apne dono haathon se aasman ki taraf kaha aur unhein uthaya."
"508","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke ye aayat dua ke bare mein nazil hui ke apni Namaz mein na buland awaz karo aur na aahista karo aur is ke darmiyan rasta dhoondo. Yahya ne kaha ke Malik se farz Namaz mein dua ke bare mein sawal kya gaya to unhon ne kaha ke is mein dua mein koi harj nahi."
"509","Mujhe Malik se riwayat pahunchi ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) dua karte kehte ke aey Allah main tujh se bhalaiyon ke karne aur buraiyon ke chhorne aur miskeenon ki mohabbat ka sawal karta hun, aur jab tu logon mein fitna chahe to mujhe baghair aazmae apni taraf utha le."
"510","Mujhe Malik se riwayat pahunchi ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke koi pukarne wala hidayat ki taraf nahi pukarta magar us ke liye us ka ajr hai jis ne us ki pairvi ki, ye un ke ajron mein se kuchh kam nahi karta, aur koi pukarne wala gumrahi ki taraf nahi pukarta magar us par un ke gunahon jaisa hai, ye un ke gunahon mein se kuchh kam nahi karta."
"511","Mujhe Malik se riwayat pahunchi ke Abdullah bin Umar ne kaha ke aey Allah mujhe muttaqiyon ke imamon mein se bana."
"512","Mujhe Malik se riwayat pahunchi ke Abu Darda raat ke darmiyan se khade hote aur kehte ke aankhein so gain aur sitare doob gae aur tu zinda qayam rakhne wala hai."
"513","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Zaid bin Aslam se, unhon ne Ata bin Yasar se, unhon ne Sanabihi Abdullah se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke suraj taloo hota hai aur us ke sath shaitan ka seeng hota hai, phir jab buland hota hai to us se juda ho jata hai, phir jab seedha hota hai to us se milta hai, phir jab dhalta hai to us se juda ho jata hai, phir jab ghuroob ke qareeb hota hai to us se milta hai, phir jab ghuroob hota hai to us se juda ho jata hai. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne in ghadiyon mein Namaz se mana kya."
"514","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmate they ke jab suraj ka kinara zaahir ho to Namaz mein takheer karo yahan tak ke nikle, aur jab suraj ka kinara ghaib ho to Namaz mein takheer karo yahan tak ke ghaib ho jaye."
"515","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ala bin Abdur Rahman se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke hum Zuhr ke baad Anas bin Malik ke paas dakhil hue to wo khade hue aur Asr ki Namaz padhi, phir jab apni Namaz se farigh hue to hum ne Namaz mein jaldi ka zikr kya ya us ka zikr kya, to unhon ne kaha ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmate suna ke ye munafiqon ki Namaz hai, ye munafiqon ki Namaz hai, ye munafiqon ki Namaz hai, un mein se koi baitha rehta hai yahan tak ke jab suraj zard ho jata hai aur shaitan ke dono seengon ke darmiyan hota hai ya shaitan ke seeng par hota hai to khada hota hai aur chaar thong marta hai jin mein Allah ko kam hi yaad karta hai."
"516","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum mein se koi suraj nikalne ke waqt aur na us ke ghuroob ke waqt Namaz padhne ka qasd na kare."
"517","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Muhammad bin Yahya bin Hibban se, unhon ne Aaraj se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Asr ke baad Namaz se mana kya yahan tak ke suraj ghuroob ho jaye aur Fajr ke baad Namaz se mana kya yahan tak ke suraj taloo ho jaye."
"518","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Dinar se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab kehte they ke apni Namaz se suraj ke nikalne aur na us ke ghuroob ka qasd na karo, kyunke shaitan apne dono seeng suraj ke nikalne ke sath nikalta hai aur un ke ghuroob ke sath ghuroob hote hain, aur wo logon ko is Namaz par marte they."
"519","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Saib bin Yazeed se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Umar bin Khattab ko dekha ke Asr ke baad Namaz mein Munkadir ko marte they."
